### KatalogKu Stage B API checks (VS Code REST Client)
### Select the local environment, then run in order. The first registration is one-time.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:18081/api
@productId = {{list.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.$.record.id}}

### 1. Gateway health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Public product list
# @name list
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?perPage=5&sort=-created

### 3. Public product details
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 4. Register user (change email if it already exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Frieren",
  "email": "frieren@katalogku.local",
  "password": "frierenlovehimmel",
  "passwordConfirm": "frierenlovehimmel"
}

### 5. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identity": "frieren@katalogku.local",
  "password": "frierenlovehimmel"
}

### 6. Add favorite (use a different product_id for each successful request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "{{userId}}",
  "product_id": "{{productId}}"
}

### 7. List only my favorites
# @name favs
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: {{token}}

### 8. Delete my first favorite
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{favs.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: {{token}}
